00:01:45.439 --> 00:01:49.020
And speaking of the Yeti, there's one, as
well as a misprinted business card, and Brotherhood

00:01:49.020 --> 00:01:54.420
2.0 resident mathematician Daniel Biss's original
paper about how circles are really just bloated

00:01:54.420 --> 00:01:55.420
