00:02:26.970 --> 00:02:30.672
So, Hank, I was just violating my social media
hiatus by looking at Twitter to see if there's

00:02:30.672 --> 00:02:33.670
anything else I should talk about, and as
it turns out that in the last hour you've

00:02:33.670 --> 00:02:34.800
launched a new company.

00:02:34.800 --> 00:02:36.060
Hank, you amaze me.

00:02:36.060 --> 00:02:37.340
That's not a compliment, exactly.

00:02:37.340 --> 00:02:38.340
It's just an observation.

00:02:38.340 --> 00:02:42.360
So, Hank, DFTBA Games, which you co-founded,
